ndia\u2019s FCNR(B) deposit mobilisation scheme has attracted more than $52 billion so far and could have crossed $80 billion, including related foreign currency borrowings, had the window remained open until the original September-end deadline. Yet, unlike the 2013 FCNR(B) programme, the rupee has failed to stage a meaningful appreciation, highlighting the influence of global monetary conditions over exchange-rate movements.\n\nThe contrast with 2013 is striking. The earlier FCNR(B) scheme, launched be", "citation": "FCNR(B) inflows stabilise rupee but fail to trigger 2013-style rally \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-17. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/forex/fcnrb-inflows-stabilise-rupee-but-fail-to-trigger-2013-style-rally/article71356433.ece"}, {"title": "Halwasiya buys 45 lakh shares of Baazar Style Retail for \u20b9163 crore in block deal", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-17T07:59:29+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/stock-markets/halwasiya-buys-45-lakh-shares-of-baazar-style-retail-for-163-crore-in-block-deal/article71355344.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Shares of Baazar Style Retail hit the 5 per cent upper circuit at \u20b9384 as Aditya Halwasiya acquired 45 lakh shares worth \u20b9163 crore in a block deal.\n\nThe investment comes at an important inflection point for Style Baazar, which has built a strong presence across eastern and other emerging markets and is now looking at a substantially larger canvas, with an ambition to rapidly expand its network to a minimum of 500 stores in three years.\n\nThe entry of Halwasiya, alongside the strategic investment already made by Cupid Ltd through warrants, represents about 12 per cent of the company on conversion.\n\nOf these warrants about 3 per cent have already been exercised into equity shares. This has cre", "citation": "Halwasiya buys 45 lakh shares of Baazar Style Retail for \u20b9163 crore in block deal \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-17. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/stock-markets/halwasiya-buys-45-lakh-shares-of-baazar-style-retail-for-163-crore-in-block-deal/article71355344.ece"}, {"title": "Baazar Style Retail shares hit 5% upper circuit on reports of Aditya Halwasia buying company shares worth  \u20b9163 crore", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-17T07:38:49+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/baazar-style-retail-shares-hit-5-upper-circuit-on-reports-of-aditya-halwasia-buying-company-shares-worth-163-crore-11786948034095.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Baazar Style Retail share price hit 5% upper circuit at \u20b9383.50 apiece in Monday's trading session after reports revealed that Aditya Halwasiya has emerged as a major shareholder following a large block deal.\n\nBazaar Style Retail shares opened at \u20b9384.45 apiece today, as compared to previous close of \u20b9366.15 on Friday last week.\n\nAccording to CNBC TV18, around 45 lakh shares of Baazar Style Retail, valued at \u20b9163 crore, were traded at \u20b9362 apiece in the block deal window. Investor Aditya Halwasiya was the buyer in the transaction, while details regarding the seller were not immediately available.\n\nThe investment marks a significant turning point for Style Baazar, which has established a stro", "citation": "Baazar Style Retail shares hit 5% upper circuit on reports of Aditya Halwasia buying company shares worth  \u20b9163 crore \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-17. https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/baazar-style-retail-shares-hit-5-upper-circuit-on-reports-of-aditya-halwasia-buying-company-shares-worth-163-crore-11786948034095.html"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "dyn_stylebaaza_ns", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 STYLEBAAZA.NS", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/STYLEBAAZA.NS"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"dyn_stylebaaza_ns": -0.47}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"dyn_stylebaaza_ns": -0.47}}, {"date": "2024-11-04", "dista